  "description": "'No one will love me!'   \n\"No one will ever trust me.\"\n\nFrequent business failures on her father's part had pushed Jia into a life of hardship, and her boyfriend of six years cheating on her had brought her to the brink of despair.\n\n\"If there's a next life...\"\n\nShe thought it was the end. But then...\n\n\"Maerin, are you awake? Are you feeling better now?\"\n\nJia reincarnates as a refugee girl named \"Maerin,\" who has crossed from the war-torn country of Helayton to Perrington. Will the new life as Maerin give Jia a chance to become wealthy and fulfill her dream of having her own home in this lifetime?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%88-%EC%9D%B8%EC%83%9D-%EB%AA%A9%ED%91%9C%EB%8A%94-%EC%9D%B4%EC%B8%B5%EC%A7%91-%EB%A7%88%EB%A0%A8/3747), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62338412)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/156546)",
